	(text "All pins power up as inputs. RESET, A1 and A0 must be biased (datasheet Table 1-1). Exposed pad to VSS, in addition to pin 17. GP2, GP3 and GP5 are spare; firmware enables weak pull-ups on them. TSC2046 PENIRQ drives GP7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0678833f-12bf-521a-990c-f5538de385e6")
	)
	(text "MCP23S08 DECOUPLING CAPACITOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
